    esp_id `r9-rhel-09-291035-aide-acl-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `rocky9`
    criticality `high`

    title `STIG RHEL-09-291035: RHEL 9 Bluetooth must be disabled.`
    description `RHEL 9 Bluetooth must be disabled.`
    author `example-security`
    tags `rhel9,stig,disa-stig`

    control_mapping `DISA-STIG:RHEL-09-291035,NIST-800-53:AC-18(1),NIST-800-53:CM-7`
